OL,3,GNEWSACancer patients centre at risk
OL,4,Aover 'disgraceful' funds move
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plan to build a haematology centre in
OL,7,FBelfast for cancer patients has been
OL,8,Fput at risk after the Department of
OL,9,FHealth (DoH) withdrew funding, the
OL,10,Fchief executive of the Belfast Trust
OL,11,Fhas said.
OL,13,FThe move was described as "disgraceful"
OL,14,Fduring Thursday's session of Stormont's
OL,15,Fhealth committee after trust officials
OL,16,Fsaid the department had now decided to
OL,17,Ftake back #1.5m from the project.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
