OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACancer patients centre at risk
OL,4,Aover 'disgraceful' funds move
OL,5,
OL,6,FBelfast Health Trust had planned to
OL,7,Fmove 80 staff out of an area of Belfast
OL,8,FCity Hospital to make way for the new
OL,9,Funit, but having reviewed the proposal
OL,10,Fthe DoH withdrew related funding.
OL,12,FThe DoH said it will fund most of the
OL,13,Fadditional cost and will work with the
OL,14,FTrust to control growing costs of
OL,15,Fcapital projects.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
